=== Text #1 ===
> We want to welcome you to the website that honors the life and work of Rev. Hugh Padgett Robinson. Although his life was cut short, he served as a minister of the Gospel for over 30 years and during that time produced a huge volume of work including books, ser[mons],[ notes], and other writings. This website features this body of[ work as] well as other interesting[ information] about his life and family.
What you see here today is a work in progress. Our plan is to add material continuously, producing two or more sermons or original works each month. It will take several years to complete the task. We hope[ that] many[ who] visit the site[ will help] with additional[ materials. If you have] ser[mons],[ photos],[ tapes, or] other[ materials] of Rev.[ Robinson that you would like to contribute, please] contact[ us] at mail@hprob[inson].[com.] We are[ also] interested[ in] hearing about how his ministry touched lives[. If you have a] testim[onial or] interesting[ story] about Rev.[ Robinson, please let us] hear[ from you.]
Thanks for taking an interest in this site. We hope that it brings joy to[ those] who visit here.

=== Text #2 ===
> Having recognized some of our childhood experiences and mistaken conclusions in parts 1 &2, here we continue to investigate the messages we received as children through people?s words, behaviors or attitudes.
If this process causes you to feel disturbed, seek the help of an experienced[ professional]. If[ possible] find an practitioner trained in[ TFT], EFT or EM[DR].
