[If] the[ zip] file includes a file named ToolbarsUser.xml, exit VueMinder by right-clicking its icon in the task tray and selecting "Exit". Extract the ToolbarsUser.[xml file] to the folder where VueMinder saves user data. The path can be found in the Program[ Options]. When VueMinder is restarted, you'll see icons that are more consistent with the appearance theme.
